{"full":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd","name":"sandboxd","description":"Open-source, self-hosted AI app builder — an agent builds real apps in isolated sandboxes on your own server, each live at a preview URL. Self-host in one command. MIT.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":963,"forks":63,"created":"2026-06-03T18:55:02Z","updated":"2026-09-29T20:52:22Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sandboxd.io/","topics":["agent-infrastructure","ai","ai-agents","app-builder","coding-agent","developer-tools","devtools","docker","llm","open-source","paas","preview-environments","sandbox","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://sandboxd.io/demo/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T18:41:00.038Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T18:41:00.038Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T18:41:00.038Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:25:26.283Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:10.334Z","stars":960,"forks":63},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:32.236Z","stars":961,"forks":63},{"at":"2026-10-05T16:57:09.660Z","stars":961,"forks":63},{"at":"2026-10-07T18:41:00.038Z","stars":963,"forks":63}],"technologies":["Go"],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:37.567Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Prompt it and a coding agent builds real apps in isolated sandboxes on your server — each live at a preview URL. You own the infra, code, and data. MIT.","The apps where you type \"build me a todo app\" and a working site appears at its own link — Lovable, Bolt, v0, Replit. sandboxd is the open-source engine that makes that work, on your own server. One HTTP request and it:","Idle sandboxes sleep and wake on demand, so one ordinary box holds many apps instead of a VM each. Under the hood it's deliberately small: one Go program driving Docker, Traefik for URLs, SQLite for state — no Kubernetes, no separate database, no queue."],"features":["spins up a private, isolated container (its own filesystem + limits),","runs an AI coding agent inside it against your prompt, and","hands the app a live preview URL."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"049fa927d41c220c21465ae6e19c58f8ce6cad1e3650834d25d8d38f2a5fd3d7","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:02:42.293Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:40.711Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Prompt it and a coding agent builds real apps in isolated sandboxes on your server — each live at a preview URL. You own the infra, code, and data. MIT.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"> Dev → prod, never shorter: prompt an app into a sandbox, iterate on a live > preview, then self-host it on your own server in one command.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"It builds the images, starts the stack with the web console, and prints your console URL + a generated login — no password step.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Console: — the installer prints your login; lost","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"> Disclosure: we earn a referral commission when you sign up through the > provider links below, at no additional cost to you.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"049fa927d41c220c21465ae6e19c58f8ce6cad1e3650834d25d8d38f2a5fd3d7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:40.711Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-29T20:52:22Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:48:23.476Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v0.3.21 — scoped API keys and Cloud analytics","tag":"v0.3.21","publishedAt":"2026-09-20T14